{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:NuclearInteractions.NuclearOperatorRegimes","@type":"LeanModule","name":"NuclearInteractions.NuclearOperatorRegimes","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.Basic"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.nuclearOperatorRegimes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.nuclearOperatorRegimes","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/nuclear-operator-regimes.lean#L66-L79","doc":"**Three operator regimes for nuclear binding** ([`prop:nuclear-operator-regimes`]).\n\nThe observed `A ≤ 6` transition sequence is `I, II, II, II, III`: shell\nfilling (`T₂,₅`) → magic closure (Hopf `L₊`/`L₋`) → open shell (bare\ncrossing `C_pn`). All three regimes are realised; the `I → II → III`\ntransition is exhibited. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:nuclear-operator-regimes","label":"prop:nuclear-operator-regimes","md":"quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/nuclear-operator-regimes.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.observedRegime","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.observedRegime","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/nuclear-operator-regimes.lean#L57-L64","doc":"The observed optimal regime at inductive construction step `k` (adding\nnucleon `k+1`), for `A ≤ 6`, from `nuclear-binding-lp.witness.json`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.instDecidableEqNuclearBindingRegime","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.instDecidableEqNuclearBindingRegime","kind":"instance","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/nuclear-operator-regimes.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.NuclearBindingRegime.openShell","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.NuclearBindingRegime.openShell","kind":"ctor","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/nuclear-operator-regimes.lean#L53-L54","doc":"Regime III: open shell — bare typed crossing `C`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.NuclearBindingRegime.magicClosure","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.NuclearBindingRegime.magicClosure","kind":"ctor","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/nuclear-operator-regimes.lean#L51-L52","doc":"Regime II: magic shell closure — Hopf link `L_±`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.NuclearBindingRegime.shellFilling","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.NuclearBindingRegime.shellFilling","kind":"ctor","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/nuclear-operator-regimes.lean#L49-L50","doc":"Regime I: shell filling — torus knot `T_{2,n_s}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.NuclearBindingRegime","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.NuclearBindingRegime","kind":"inductive","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/nuclear-operator-regimes.lean#L46-L55","doc":"The three discrete inter-nucleon binding regimes of\n`prop:nuclear-operator-regimes`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}